"\n\nDevice volume controls the selected device's master volume and remains usable during exclusive access when the driver supports it. Digital output gain stays at 0 dB when device volume is writable. Otherwise the card offers digital gain as a fallback. Device volume is downstream of the software output meters. " = "\n\nDevice volume controls the selected device's master volume and remains usable during exclusive access when the driver supports it. Digital output gain stays at 0 dB when device volume is writable. Otherwise the card offers digital gain as a fallback. Device volume is downstream of the software output meters. ";
"\n\nDigital output gain is the fallback in the Bridge tab. It changes the stereo signal smoothly before physical output mapping. When writable device volume is available, digital gain is fixed at 0 dB; the saved fallback setting is retained for devices without volume control." = "\n\nDigital output gain is the fallback in the Bridge tab. It changes the stereo signal smoothly before physical output mapping. When writable device volume is available, digital gain is fixed at 0 dB; the saved fallback setting is retained for devices without volume control.";
"\n\nLogin item: %@.\n\nAfter configuring your route, press Start once to save running intent. A deliberate Stop stays stopped across relaunch, even with resume enabled. Quit preserves the last intent. Device loss or format changes require explicit re-arming. Other recoverable callback failures retry the selected UIDs; permission, configuration and unsafe teardown faults require action. No alternative output is selected." = "\n\nLogin item: %@.\n\nAfter configuring your route, press Start once to save running intent. A deliberate Stop stays stopped across relaunch, even with resume enabled. Quit preserves the last intent. Device loss or format changes require explicit re-arming. Other recoverable callback failures retry the selected UIDs; permission, configuration and unsafe teardown faults require action. No alternative output is selected.";
"\n\nThe main value includes callback buffers, software queues, resampler lookahead and declared AU signal latency. Device and stream latency reports add a separate allowance; small buffers do not remove that internal delay. Missing reports remain unknown. Startup reserve is not added twice. AU processing wall time is performance telemetry and is not added to signal delay.\n\nActual end-to-end latency requires a loopback measurement. Enable interface debug information in Diagnostics for the accounting breakdown." = "\n\nThe main value includes callback buffers, software queues, resampler lookahead and declared AU signal latency. Device and stream latency reports add a separate allowance; small buffers do not remove that internal delay. Missing reports remain unknown. Startup reserve is not added twice. AU processing wall time is performance telemetry and is not added to signal delay.\n\nActual end-to-end latency requires a loopback measurement. Enable interface debug information in Diagnostics for the accounting breakdown.";
