"Simple mode requests the same hardware buffer on both devices. FIFO reserve and AU blocks are chosen automatically. Drivers must confirm the requested size; otherwise choose another value or switch to Expert. Apply requests the shared sample rate and buffer on both devices. It is a device-wide change that can affect other audio apps. A partial failure is reported; Start stays blocked until both readbacks match. Audio MIDI Setup remains available for driver-managed controls. Switching modes never changes hardware by itself. Expert settings are retained." = "Simple mode requests the same hardware buffer on both devices. FIFO reserve and AU blocks are chosen automatically. Drivers must confirm the requested size; otherwise choose another value or switch to Expert. Apply requests the shared sample rate and buffer on both devices. It is a device-wide change that can affect other audio apps. A partial failure is reported; Start stays blocked until both readbacks match. Audio MIDI Setup remains available for driver-managed controls. Switching modes never changes hardware by itself. Expert settings are retained.";
